WEBVTT

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.150
This is getting on my nerves!

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:59.270
"Dragon Crisis"

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.210
See you later.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.340
Later.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:14.370
I'm exhausted.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:18.920
Good morning, Eriko.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.550
Could I get some breakfast?

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.670
I've forgotten to consume nutrients since yesterday.

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:28.280
Another tiresome one.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:40.610
Rose.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.450
Are you okay?

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.680
I'm fine. Thanks.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.450
Really?

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.970
"Ryuji, I love you."

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:12.340
I long for the peaceful days of yesterday.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.590
This change has been too drastic.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.080
It's an interesting story.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.410
I didn't realize she had such a behavior.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.070
It's not a big deal.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:27.180
We can't have her acting like a child forever.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.830
But there's got to be limits. I can't stand watching them.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.260
This is only the first day. How's it going to be in the future?

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.930
Eriko, let me borrow your computer.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:42.690
I checked that yesterday. I didn't find anything particularly useful.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.590
What is this?

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.830
It's hidden even deeper than the top secret pages.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:56.970
As I told you yesterday, the society is currently very interested in dragon behavior.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:02.020
Naked men are in this winter?

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.170
Is it finally my turn?

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.700
Hey, Misaki.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:09.110
Haven't you gotten closer to that girl?

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:11.740
You mean Rose-chan?

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:14.040
Yeah. Did something happen?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.620
Uh...

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.890
Good morning, Ryuji-kun.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.310
Good morning.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:22.560
Good morning.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.710
Good morning.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.060
Misaki.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.860
Good morning.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.320
I have a problem. Will you listen?

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:38.600
But wouldn't you catch a cold going naked in the winter?

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:39.960
Masato.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.120
Hey, Ryuji.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.750
Do you have a minute?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.550
Something's wrong with me.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.430
When I touch Ryuji, my body tingles.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.430
My heart pounds.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.200
My face burns up.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:59.110
Eriko says it's nothing to worry about, but it bothers me.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.870
I thought things would be back to normal today, but things haven't changed.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.350
What happened?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.970
He kissed me here, and I became an adult.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.640
Misaki, are you okay?

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.460
It's weird.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:21.740
Yesterday I was fine if Rose hugged me, but now I can't even look at her.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.980
You seem to know a lot about women...

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.350
so I was hoping you could tell me what to do.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.190
My friend.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.980
I misunderstood you.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.330
Even though you're surrounded by beautiful girls...

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:40.050
you're not bursting with a young man's libido and passion!

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.540
It's weird! It's not right!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.870
You're like the protagonist of a harem anime!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.930
But you're just another cherry boy worried about love and desire.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:54.240
My heart is finally free.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:58.220
I feel like a wall formed suddenly in mine.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:03.190
That's what you meant by adult? That's confusing.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.890
I'm sorry.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.170
It's okay. I misunderstood.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.240
Foreigners sure have different customs.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.680
Why are you asking Misaki for advice?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.600
Misaki likes Ryuji too...

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.190
so I thought she would understand how I feel.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:25.790
I love Ryuji, but I can't leave things like this.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.330
What should I do?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.710
What should you do?

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:31.450
You're not asking the right person.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.260
Mao-chan.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.340
Class is starting. Let's go.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:40.490
We can talk later, Rose-chan.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.400
Okay.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.600
Unfortunately, I haven't experienced the real deal yet...

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.960
but the idea is to just give it your best shot.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.770
My best shot?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.400
They've done their research.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.980
On biology, yes.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:07.260
Traditions, customs and psychology are still a mystery.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.010
There's no relevant data.

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:12.050
I will provide counseling for them.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:16.080
You don't think that would traumatize them?

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.390
What do you mean?

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.830
Rose, open up.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.850
I forgot my shoes yesterday.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:28.020
I got them from Onyx.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.730
Untie this rope from me!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:40.490
It's an anti-dragon rope made from a Lost Precious.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:44.480
We can do what we want with this girl?

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:46.990
Let's see.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:55.740
You'd better tell us what's going to happen to Rose, or else.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.010
Rose?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.520
If you don't do something, she'll take Ryuji from you.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.760
She lives with him.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.290
There's no reason for you to help your enemy any more.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.030
But Rose-chan seemed worried.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:25.300
I might have been a little harsh...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:29.470
but I want things to work out for you.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.120
Mao-chan.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:42.450
But it won't be easy.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.710
Nothing will happen to her.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:51.000
She'll just love him more and more...

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.600
and prepare to be joined with him.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.900
Prepare to be joined?

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.620
You mean ovulate?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.290
Talk about unromantic.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.220
But yes, something like that.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.650
Did you turn red and space out, too?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.520
Yes, but she'll get over it soon.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:18.200
I felt a lot calmer after one night's rest.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.630
One night?

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:24.140
Eriko, when did Rose perform the coming of age ritual with Ryuji?

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:25.830
Last night.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.390
Rose-san?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.090
Rose-san.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:52.780
What's wrong?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.990
Rose-chan?

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:54.890
Rose!

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.950
Rose. Rose!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.230
Quickly, take her to the nurse's office.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:03.480
No!

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.810
No viruses detected.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.950
No external factors.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.550
We're currently holding off on medicating her.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:41.450
To be honest, I'm not sure what would help and what would hurt.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.230
All you can do is gather data.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.780
Precisely.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.380
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.200
Is Rose sick?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.600
I don't know.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.540
This didn't happen to me.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:58.450
Her fever is high and she's sweating profusely.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.830
If she were human, she'd be in serious condition.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:05.130
Ryuji-kun.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.500
Please tell us what we should do.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.990
What will make Rose return to normal?

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:15.530
I don't know.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:19.050
If you untie me, I'll go ask Onyx.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.730
No need for that.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.240
You!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.290
Kai!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.190
How did you get in here?

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.790
A fake ID?

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.770
Here. I got these for you.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.420
You really are a lot of trouble.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.750
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.450
We came to solve the problem.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.280
"We?"

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:46.040
Yes. Kisaragi Ryuji, Onyx wishes to speak with you.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.350
With only you.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.870
It's a Lost Precious.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.430
It transmits the voice of a distant person.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.700
Hey. It's good to see you again.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.040
Onyx.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.120
Sorry I couldn't meet you personally.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.090
It'll be a while longer before I can appear in public.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:29.630
Tell me what's happening to Rose.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.140
How can we return her to normal?

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.650
Using Sapphie to do that to Rose was a dirty trick.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.580
You've got the wrong idea.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:41.730
Neither Sapphie nor I have any ill intentions.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.110
You're the one who made Rose collapse.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:49.710
The coming of age ritual requires a dragon.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.290
It's meaningless with a mere human.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.550
Sapphie must not have known.

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.880
Then why has Rose changed?

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:02.650
Because you're not a mere human.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:06.890
Not because you're a breaker or anything.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.900
I took a little trip to do some research.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:15.550
Why you can use the Slash Breath.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:18.040
Why you're able to engage with Rose.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:23.680
Ryuji, you're a Lost Precious true to your name.

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:27.540
A Lost Precious with power over dragons.

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:32.160
It's why you're able to associate with dragons.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.770
Defeat and even control them.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.580
I'm a human.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.250
I have a father and a mother.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.470
I don't know about that...

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.660
but you know there's a wide variety of Lost Preciouses.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:53.350
That's why Rose is responding the way she is.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:57.650
Deep in her heart, she must fear you.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:01.940
Why would she be afraid of me?

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:06.580
Because you're an enemy who steals our freedom.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.100
You're a destroyer.

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.800
A Dragon Crisis.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:16.220
It's up to you whether you want to believe me or not.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.080
There's not much time left.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:22.860
As long as you stay with her, Rose will grow weaker.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.190
Is there any way to cure her?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.460
Hand her over to Kai.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:29.230
We will treat her.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.790
You expect me to believe you?

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:32.900
You hurt Rose.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.010
Are you stupid?

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:37.790
I only tried to kill you.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:42.980
You stole the girl I was going to make my bride.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:48.610
I lost my temper over her attachment to you...

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.570
but with you out of the picture, everything will be fine.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.160
Think about it.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.500
We're of the same kind.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.060
Why wouldn't we cure her?

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:03.650
Isn't this the part where you barge in and cut me to shreds?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.130
Just like you did to my body.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.140
To humans, dragons are a treasure.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:13.310
She must have people after her.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.620
Can you trust them?

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.130
Rose's life is on the line.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:27.210
I told you humans and dragons could never be together.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:30.580
Allow me to correct myself.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.480
Humans and dragons can be together...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:38.970
but you and Rose will never be together.

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.230
Shut up!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:48.260
Fool. You don't have a choice.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.830
Please help Rose.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.890
You finally understand.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.240
Support Kai.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:05.990
Keep the society members at bay.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:09.180
We're not kidnapping her this time.

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:13.060
You're choosing to part ways with her.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.620
Otherwise you won't be able to let go.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.240
Please stand back.

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.430
Kisaragi Ryuji!

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.470
Please stay away!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.730
Allow me to say goodbye for her.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.780
Get him!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.890
We got him!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.830
Follow them! Send a vehicle!

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.740
You bastard!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.730
Ryuji.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.340
Ai, what's wrong?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.740
I was in the area.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.890
I happened to have an extra lunch, so I brought it for you.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:23.270
Gorgeous!

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:25.980
Why do you always get everything?

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:29.840
Ai, would it be all right if I shared with everyone?

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.880
I can't eat all of this myself.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.710
Well, okay.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.250
You have to eat this.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:40.420
Oh? Did you make those, Ai-chan?

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:42.740
That's got nothing to do with it.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.250
Let me see.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.150
Egg yolks, egg whites, salt and sugar.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:52.770
An excellent combination, but there's problems with the execution.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.320
Don't eat that!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.290
Cut it out, you two.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.260
You've traded one problem for another.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:01.460
You should hurry up and confess.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.620
Ryuji-kun, more alcohol.

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.770
You've had too much.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:13.180
The society held me for two weeks.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.800
I'm blowing off steam.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.660
Give me ice.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:19.290
Unbelievable.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.070
Uh, what is it?

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.810
I'm not the one who needs to see you.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.760
Rose-chan still hasn't come home?

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:59.000
I don't think she's coming back.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.000
What do you mean?

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:04.600
I can't really explain it.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:09.860
Conditions weren't right for her here, so she's resting among her kind.

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:12.190
Her kind?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.660
Don't worry.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:18.020
It's what's best for Rose.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.790
There's nothing I can do for her.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.800
I see.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:25.110
Yeah. Everyone's...

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.260
That's what's been wrong with you.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.140
You've been acting weird.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:31.930
That's not true.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:35.170
It's been a while, and I've accepted it.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.170
No, I can tell.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:42.020
I can't explain it, but I've been watching you.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.950
You've changed since the summer.

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:55.420
Since Eriko-san came back and Rose and the others showed up, you've been different.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:21:00.110
I was just watching, but things have changed.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.780
I liked watching you.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.320
It was exciting.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.450
But you're different now.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:14.640
You talk and laugh like you always do, but it's not real.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.240
It's like you're empty.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:21.840
If something's bothering you, you can tell me...

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.200
if there's something I can do for you.

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:30.360
Thanks, but I'm fine.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:35.870
I see.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:51.260
We have to talk.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:53.760
Maruga?

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:39.960
Next episode "Engage"

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:28.350
Sorry for hurting you, Rose...

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:33.590
but I want to see you again so I can tell you how I really feel.

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:35.920
Will you listen?

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:39.780
I'll be waiting, Ryuji.
